1
00:00:14,688 --> 00:00:20,228
Salut, Marinette ! Tu as changé de coiffure ?
Hi, Marinette! Have you changed your hairstyle?

2
00:00:20,328 --> 00:00:27,020
Oui, et je vais devenir styliste. Je me sens calme aujourd’hui.
Yes, and I’m going to become a stylist. I feel calm today.

3
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:32,588
Tu sembles heureuse. Tu as grandi depuis l’an dernier !
You seem happy. You’ve grown since last year!

4
00:00:32,688 --> 00:00:39,236
Merci ! Mon grand-père vieillit, mais il reste très actif.
Thanks! My grandfather is getting older, but he stays very active.

5
00:00:39,336 --> 00:00:42,116
Oh, il est malade ?
Oh, is he sick?

6
00:00:42,216 --> 00:00:48,908
Non, il va bien. Il est tombé hier, mais rien de grave.
No, he’s fine. He fell yesterday, but nothing serious.

7
00:00:49,008 --> 00:00:54,212
Tant mieux. On change de sujet et on va au café ?
That’s good. Shall we change the subject and go to the café?

8
00:00:54,312 --> 00:00:56,996
Avec plaisir !
With pleasure!
